// ===== L61: favorites, Pivotal, ways to order the shelves, and one journal for days, books and media (approved Nov 17 2026: mock, then "Go").
// His words (Nov 17 2026): "Let me favorite books and let them be grouped by ratings, organize buttons for date added, date
// finished, date published rating, let me be able to select certain media and label it pivotal. Journal option for overall days,
// books, and media make book den a home".
// Every book, show and game has two marks he sets on its page: Favorite and Pivotal. Home shows today's journal line, his
// favorites and what he has called pivotal. Books has a Favorites view (favorites by his rating, pivotal by kind, everything he
// has rated by rating) and buttons that order any shelf by title, date added, date finished, year published or his rating.
// The Journal holds three kinds of writing: days, books (the journals he already keeps) and media. Nothing moves.
